                                "sense_id": "044bac48-dee0-39f8-9cab-7094b3beadda",
                                "text": "Nevertheless, while keeping a close eye on Melissa's sleeping form, he managed to paw her clothing a second time. Only after he'd resqueezed and rehandled each piece of it did he conclude that the Mexican A was in the big zippered outer pocket of her bag."
